:"2023-08-22T11:06:00","session_id":"session_15","session_index":15,"source_sha256":"1aeb1708d76b6b3f0b400f5fe333456b7ba36d60090278db2ccd5a53a8366b30","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":11}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- Dave (apparently Boston-based) is offering to show him around — including Paradise Rock, House of Blues, and Fenway Park — and to take him to his favorite food spots; Calvin proposed grabbing a bite together when he is in Boston, and Dave agreed [S3T10][S3T15][S3T16] (see /memories/dave.md > ## Boston).\n- Calvin is looking forward to trying the food in Boston with Dave and called it fun (\"Can't wait to try out the food there with you\") [S3T17].\n- As of 2023-05-31, the Boston visit is part of the Frank Ocean tour: \"Cool, can't wait for the tour with Frank!\" — he's \"buzzing to perform in Boston and see what it's like\" and \"Gonna be great playing for folks from home\" (calling Boston's folks \"from home\" suggests it is where he's from, though not stated outright). He asked Dave what he thinks of the music scene there; Dave: it's \"awesome — Tons of talented musicians and cool places to play,\" and he'll be there to cheer Calvin on (details in /memories/dave.md > ## Boston) [S7T15][S7T16].\n- On 2023-06-09, said he has never been to Boston before but has heard the parks are amazing — \"can't wait to visit next month\" (i.e., July 2023); he wants to take walks in the Boston parks to experience their serenity and recharge, and asked Dave what cool things he remembers about them; shared a photo of a tree with pink flowers (likely from the album session); Dave's recollections of the Boston parks are in /memories/dave.md > ## Boston [S8T5][S8T7].\n- As of 2023-08-22, said his tour ends soon and he's heading to Boston, and proposed meeting up with Dave then — \"Maybe we can meet up then!\" (renewing the earlier plan to meet in Boston, see above); Dave: \